{"version":1,"content":"<p>影壇盛事《第63屆台灣金馬獎》昨晚假台北流行音樂中心舉行，最終由劉冠廷及袁澧林稱帝封后。</p><p>翁倩玉相隔54年再登金馬舞台獲頒「最佳女配角」，全身戴有亡母首飾的她致謝詞時不忘提醒大家父母「時間有限」，感動全場。</p><p>至於阮經天主演的《狂忘警探》入圍11</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.276240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:32.369957+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:32.369957+00:00","content_hash":"82c1579b0eecf6ea3d323e165afe2ab6e5b0aa2238c184250fe5fe4c5a6e32da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}